  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0px; color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.32px;\">(19 fotos) Mar&iacute;a Dolores Garc&iacute;a Lengua&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">ha ganado los 2000 euros del primer premio del sorteo de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial (OCC) para gastar en tiendas que pertenecen a esta entidad. Deposit&oacute; su papeleta en Esports Lizondo. Ese premio y otros 20 por 200 &euro; se entregan este jueves, 14 de enero, a las 20.30 horas, en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320938.jpg\" alt=\"p1320938\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320940.jpg\" alt=\"p1320940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320941.jpg\" alt=\"p1320941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320942.jpg\" alt=\"p1320942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320944.jpg\" alt=\"p1320944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320945.jpg\" alt=\"p1320945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadal1516ondacentrecomercial/p1320946.jpg\" alt=\"p1320946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\"